# is-07-codereview-project — environment example
#
# This reference app has NO required runtime secrets (no database, demo auth).
# This file exists so the review tooling has a safe target to check:
# ✅ placeholders only, ❌ never a real secret.
#
# If you extend the app with real services, add their vars here as PLACEHOLDERS
# and document where to get the value. Real values go in `.env.local` (gitignored).

# Example shape only — replace with your own if you add a PR-bot CI integration:
# CODE_REVIEW_API_KEY=REPLACE_ME
